                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, if the target has been destroyed, add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of friendly **^^Eshin^^** units.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
