                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another friendly **^^Skaven Hero^^** on the battlefield with a Health characteristic that equals or exceeds this unit&apos;s Health characteristic to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle:
• While the target has not been slain, friendly **^^Skaven Infantry^^** units have **^^Ward (6+)^^** while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• Once the target has been slain, add 2 to charge rolls for friendly **^^Skaven Infantry^^** units while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
