                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">You can re-roll the random characteristic rolls for the Move characteristic of friendly **^^Skryre War Machines^^** while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit. In addition, each time a friendly **^^Skryre War Machine^^** wholly within 18&quot; of this unit uses the &apos;Rolling Doom&apos; or &apos;Whirling Doom&apos; ability, add 1 to the amount of mortal damage inflicted, if any.</characteristic>
